# MANUAL SPEC MUTANT r4-a01-padd/01
# type: ComplexTestStruct
# ops: encode
# spec: the size of a container is the sum of its fixed part and its variable parts; a sum that overflows U32 must be the marker, and the marker must be absorbing
# fault: the wrap test is dropped (only a + b < marker is tested): a sum that wraps past 2^32 looks like a small valid size
# why: an implementer guards against reaching the marker but forgets that a U32 sum can wrap
# file: src/obj.bend
# sym: padd,is_poisoned
--- a/src/obj.bend
+++ b/src/obj.bend
@@ -1753,3 +1753,3 @@
 # Add two counts: the sum when it neither wraps nor reaches the marker, else the marker (so the marker is absorbing).
-def padd(+a: U32, +b: U32) -> U32: pick(Bool.and(U32.is_le(a, (a + b : U32)), U32.is_lt((a + b : U32), 4294967295)), (a + b : U32), 4294967295)
+def padd(+a: U32, +b: U32) -> U32: pick(U32.is_lt((a + b : U32), 4294967295), (a + b : U32), 4294967295)
 
